  render_theorem(sec1, "Architecture Theorem (PROVED)", "Shared backbone + CRT output = unique optimal point. Shared backbone maximizes error detection reliability (correlated representations across channels). CRT output maximizes efficiency (5 small softmaxes instead of 1 large one). 7.5x fewer output parameters. 212x output backprop speedup at Z/12,612,600 scale. 2.68x error detection reliability vs split backbone.");
