  render_p(sec7d, "The 9-heads hypothesis (7 single-channel + 2 pair-channel = optimal head count) shows no statistically significant signal across 5 random seeds. All head counts from 7 to 21 give similar contrast (~50%). CRT attention works best as FULL COUPLING (all 7 channels simultaneously), not decomposed into independent heads.");
