  render_theorem(sec7l, "Block-Diagonal FLOP Theorem (PROVED)", "Matmul FLOP ratio = (sum q_i)^3 / sum(q_i^3). Z/210 (4ch): 9x. Z/12,612,600 (6ch): 11x. Z/214,414,200 (7ch): 16x. Scale-invariant. Parameter savings: (sum q_i)^2 / sum(q_i^2) = 4.6x at 7 channels. Neural net layer (attention mono + FFN block-diag): 3.4x total. 12-layer CRT-GPT: ~25M params vs ~117M standard. 24/24 checks pass.");
